# Static rewrites/redirects served by the Workers Assets layer (no Worker invocation).
# 200 = rewrite (serve target content at the original URL); 301 = redirect.
# NOTE: _redirects cannot match on host and rejects absolute URLs, so the homepage
# host-branching (SUMINISTROS root vs DESAPARECIDOS registry) is done in the Worker
# via run_worker_first in wrangler.toml. The rule below stays as the default target.
# Comments here are plain ASCII on purpose: a non-ASCII char (em dash) in this block
# previously made the Cloudflare Assets parser reject the file (only-relative-URLs).

/                /personas          200

# Legacy La Guaira deep-link to the generalized state template (Worker-owned).
/la-guaira       /estado/la-guaira  301
